            "title": "HEM/BC"
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us:</th></tr><tr><td>The patient shows marked anemia (low hemoglobin and hematocrit) with normal red cell indices, suggesting normocytic, normochromic anemia. Leukocyte and platelet counts are within normal limits, but platelet distribution width is elevated, possibly indicating increased platelet size variability. Further evaluation for causes of anemia (e.g., blood loss, chronic disease) is recommended.</td></tr></table></div>"
